    <item>
      <title>AI奥数金牌战：谷歌Gemini真香，OpenAI惨遭“社死”现场？</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/aigeminiopenai-20250722131005273-0/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 22 Jul 2025 13:10:05 +0800</pubDate>
